  "prefLabel": "Env-Wr 304.02 Inspection",
  "priorExpiration": "2005-08-20",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 304.02 Inspection. Within 30 days of receipt of the permit application, the department shall inspect the dam and area affected by the dam for conditions and factors affecting the hazard potential classification, and make a determination whether repair or reconstruction of the dam is required for the public safety and provide such information to the owner.\n\nSource. #1716, eff 2-20-81; ss by #2207, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2900, eff 11-7-84, EXPIRED 11-7-90\n\nNew. #5080, eff 2-22-91; ss by #6462-B, eff 2-21-97; ss by #8285, INTERIM, eff 2-21-05, EXPIRES: 8-20-05; ss by #8414, eff 8-20-05; ss by #10510, eff 1-22-14; ss by #13980, eff 5-24-24",
